<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-021" chapter-id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi" source-id="s-nanshi-021-wangxi-ws1752646">
  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAA">錫</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAA">寡光</persName>，位太子左衛率、江夏內史，高自位遇。太尉江夏王<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0027" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">義恭</persName>當朝，<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0032" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAA">錫</persName>箕踞大坐，殆無推敬。卒，子<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0046" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAAA">僧亮</persName>嗣，齊受禪，降爵爲侯。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0059" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAAA">僧亮</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0062" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAAB">僧衍</persName>，位侍中。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0069" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA">弘</persName>少子<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangxi:p001:m0072" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAB">僧達</persName>。</p>
</text>
